    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Draft pending legal review — no applications are being accepted.</strong>
      The secure application channel is not enabled, so no candidate data is collected or stored
      through this website. This outline must be reviewed and approved before any application is accepted.
    </div>

    <h2>Who controls candidate data</h2>
    <p>The controlling legal entity and a named contact for recruitment data are pending corporate
      confirmation and will be stated here before any application is accepted.</p>

    <h2>What would be collected</h2>
    <p>If and when applications open: your name, email, phone, current location, the role applied for,
      years of experience, an optional professional profile link, an optional short note, and your
      resume.</p>

    <h2>How it would be used</h2>
    <p>Solely to assess your application against the published requirements of the role you applied for,
      and to contact you about it. Applications are reviewed by the recruiting team and the relevant
      hiring manager. No automated decision-making or AI screening is used to reject candidates.</p>

    <h2>Storage, retention and rights</h2>
    <p>Resumes would be held in private storage with authenticated staff access only, never a public
      link. The retention period, deletion process and your rights of access and correction are
      pending legal review and will be set out here before applications open.</p>
  </div>
</section>
